---
pagination:
  data: labs
  size: 1
  alias: lab
permalink: "lab_{{ lab.numberStr }}.html"
layout: base.njk
tags: lab
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Lab {{ lab.numberStr }}{% if lab.title %}: {{ lab.title }}{% endif %}"
icon: fa-flask
navigation:
  - name: "Home"
    link: "index.html"
    icon: "fa-gavel"
---

<h2>Task 1: Notebook</h2>

<p>Open the lab in Google Colab, save a copy to your Drive, and work through it during the Thursday lab session.</p>

{% if lab.link %}
<div class="alert alert-success">
<a href="{{ lab.link }}">{% if lab.opensCopy %}OPEN A COPY IN GOOGLE COLAB{% else %}OPEN NOTEBOOK{% endif %}</a>
</div>
{% else %}
<div class="alert alert-warning">
<p>Notebook link not yet available. Please check back later.</p>
</div>
{% endif %}

{% if lab.previewBase %}
<p>For your convenience the notebook is displayed below as HTML, but you will likely
find it easier to copy the notebook from the Google Colab link above.</p>

<div class="embed-responsive embed-responsive-4by3">
<iframe
    class="embed-responsive-item course-embed theme-notebook-frame"
    width="100%"
    height="800"
    src="{{ lab.previewBase }}-light.html"
    data-src-light="{{ lab.previewBase }}-light.html"
    data-src-dark="{{ lab.previewBase }}-dark.html"></iframe>
</div>
{% elif lab.link %}
<div class="alert alert-warning">
<p>Rendered notebook preview not yet available. Use the Google Colab link above.</p>
</div>
{% endif %}

<h2>Task 2: Assignment Submission Instructions</h2>

<p>Follow the notebook's final export instructions, then upload the generated HTML file to Canvas.</p>
